                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>The <strong>Forge Pro</strong> is designed with security as a top priority. It operates using <strong>read-only network data</strong> and requires only basic connectivity information to function. The device never requests sensitive credentials, private keys, access codes, or personal data, ensuring safe and isolated operation at all times.</p>",
