            "media_type": "image",
            "video_url": "",
            "tab_heading": "Advanced Architecture",
            "tab_content": "Powered by the 2025 ESP32-D0 processing chip, the MinerForge Pro is engineered for high-efficiency computation in a compact form factor. Our proprietary firmware utilizes adaptive logic to target network block signatures efficiently.\n<br><br>\nExperience a streamlined mining interface with integrated hardware management designed specifically for the solo mining enthusiast."
          }
        },
