    "miner_pioneer_steps_3Eeyx4": {
      "type": "miner-pioneer-steps",
      "name": "Forge Pioneer Steps",
      "settings": {
        "primary_color": "#1a61f9",
        "heading": "Setup in minutes, plug and play",
        "subheading": "Follow our simple guide to get your Forge Pro up and running.",
        "step1_title": "Step 1 - Document your journey",
        "step1_desc": "Take a photo of your setup. You’ll be pleasantly surprised at how easy it is to monitor your device’s activity in real time.",
        "step2_title": "Step 2 - Connect to Wi-Fi",
        "step2_desc": "Plug the device into a USB-C port. Enter your Wi-Fi credentials to establish a secure network connection.",
        "step3_title": "Step 3 - Stick to it for 60 days",
        "step3_desc": "Consistency matters. 93% of users reported more stable device operation after keeping their device running continuously for 60 days.",
        "media_type": "image",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Osm.png",
        "video_url": "",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "section_cF3GM6": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Tmzim4": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p>Still have questions? Reach out to us anytime at <a href=\"mailto:support@mineblock.co\" title=\"mailto:support@mineblock.co\">support@mineblock.co</a> — we’re here to help.</p>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_jG9Kw9": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "name": "t:names.accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true,
            "color_scheme": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_nyfWy9": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What are the chances of discovering a block?",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_ignjJx": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The mathematical probability of discovering a block with a single hobbyist device is <strong>extremely low</strong>. This device should be viewed as a \"lottery-style\" participant in the network. While individual hobbyists have successfully solved blocks in the past, it is not a predictable source of income.</p>",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_ignjJx"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_8QG6nw": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Does buying more miners improve my chances?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_K3WTgV": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Each device operates as an independent node attempting to solve a hash. Operating multiple devices increases your total hash rate, which proportionally increases your statistical probability of block discovery.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_K3WTgV"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_DByEAY": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What is my chance to win?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_qdaUBY": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The chances are extremely low. Think of it like a global lottery. Your device continuously generates valid entries, and while odds depend on network difficulty, every single hash has a fair chance. People have already proven small devices can win.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_qdaUBY"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_K7fLT6": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Are there any hidden fees?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Wj8UhR": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No. There are no subscriptions or hidden costs. Once you purchase the hardware, you own it, and all hashing power is directed to your chosen address.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_Wj8UhR"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_Lgiq6Q": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Do I need any technical skills to set this up?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_VgfGpw": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Not at all. Simply plug the device into power, connect to Wi-Fi once using your phone, and it’s ready to operate. No coding, no additional hardware, and no prior experience required.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_VgfGpw"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_7j7ewC": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Do I need a computer to run this?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_rPUXVd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No. Everything runs directly on the device. You only need a smartphone, tablet, or computer for the initial Wi-Fi setup. After that, it works completely on its own.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_rPUXVd"
              ]
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "accordion_row_nyfWy9",
            "accordion_row_8QG6nw",
            "accordion_row_DByEAY",
            "accordion_row_K7fLT6",
            "accordion_row_Lgiq6Q",
            "accordion_row_7j7ewC"
          ]
        }
